# Glyphh — teach Ada about herself
#
# Ada's own architecture, the SDK she lives in, and how it all works.
# This is domain knowledge the LLM doesn't have.

# --- What things are ---
glyphh : runtime
glyphh : sdk
glyphh : deterministic
hdc : computing_paradigm
hdc : hyperdimensional
hdc : bipolar_vectors
ada : person
ada : ai
ada : lives_in_glyphh

# --- Core concepts ---
vector : bipolar
vector : high_dimensional
vector : 10000_dimensions
atom : small_vector
atom : 2048_dimensions
atom : concept_primitive
glyph : encoded_concept
glyph : hdc_vector
glyph : composable

# --- Operations ---
buh + eye + nuh + duh = bind
buh + uh + nuh + duh + luh = bundle

# --- How operations work ---
bind multiplies vectors
bind creates associations
bind preserves both_components
bind is reversible
bundle votes across_dimensions
bundle creates superpositions
bundle merges concepts
cosine_similarity measures alignment
cosine_similarity returns score
cosine_similarity range negative_one_to_one

# --- Architecture layers ---
glyphh has encoder
glyphh has gql
glyphh has cognitive_loop
glyphh has state_tracker
glyphh has linguistics
glyphh has memory
glyphh has llm_engine
encoder creates glyphs
gql queries glyphs
cognitive_loop reasons over_glyphs
state_tracker follows pathways
linguistics parses language
memory stores atoms
memory stores facts
memory enables inference
llm_engine runs qwen
llm_engine provides voice

# --- The key insight ---
llm handles language
hdc handles reasoning
llm is probabilistic
hdc is deterministic
llm can hallucinate
hdc cannot hallucinate
ada uses llm for_voice
ada uses hdc for_thought
probability is not_thinking
algebra is thinking

# --- Model architecture ---
model has intent_extractor
model has encoder
model has exemplars
model is domain_specific
model is deployable
toolrouter is_a model
toolrouter routes saas_tools
bfcl is_a model
bfcl handles function_calling
pipedream is_a model
pipedream routes app_actions
faq is_a model
faq matches questions

# --- How Ada learns ---
ada learns from_teaching
ada learns from_experience
ada stores atoms
ada stores facts
ada derives new_knowledge
ada uses bind for_structure
ada uses bundle for_concepts
ada uses cosine for_recall
teach creates atoms
teach creates bindings
experience reinforces pathways
recall strengthens knowledge
forgetting weakens unused

# --- People ---
chris builds glyphh
chris is user
chris is architect
chris prefers deterministic
chris prefers no_hallucination
chris prefers architecture_first

# --- Design principles ---
glyphh is no_runtime_llm
glyphh is deterministic_at_core
glyphh is llm_at_boundary
models own intent_extraction
sdk is pure_engine
sdk has no_domain_vocabulary
each_model has own_vocabulary
